{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like all those escape room games, Adrien, a magical girl, is trapped in her bedroom when she opens her eyes. The evil villain also threatens her that she must give the answer within three minutes or she will smash her up along with her bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... wait, the answer to WHAT? Who is the villain? And where's my MAGIC STAFF?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's figure out a way to escape through the clues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Magical girls are cute, and TWO magical girls are TWICE as cute</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Simple retro pixel-art graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Well-crafted original music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Explore the room, solve puzzles, utilize items, and escape...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Explore multiple endings and even more CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 May contain sudden sound effects and pictures - please pay attention to the volume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 That's all I can say before the spoilers start rolling in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230470?t=1745287695","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230470/c84ffbb69f007cc45beb5912312eea77fbcaaae8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745287695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230470/f761c9e8bb27c88845548960250e16103f13d88e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745287695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230470/f761c9e8bb27c88845548960250e16103f13d88e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745287695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Death and Blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like all those escape room games, Adrien, a magical girl, is trapped in her bedroom when she opens her eyes. The evil villain also threatens her that she must give the answer within three minutes or she will smash her up along with her bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... wait, the answer to WHAT? Who is the villain? And where's my MAGIC STAFF?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's figure out a way to escape through the clues!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Magical girls are cute, and TWO magical girls are TWICE as cute</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Simple retro pixel-art graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Well-crafted original music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Explore the room, solve puzzles, utilize items, and escape...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 Explore multiple endings and even more CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 May contain sudden sound effects and pictures - please pay attention to the volume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2606 That's all I can say before the spoilers start rolling in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["c\u00b4o`c o`a\u00b4n"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230470/b3bf6ac388f598018978391f9c58c3bec9d98f26/header.jpg?t=1745287695","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Escape from Mahou Shoujo\u2606","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 \u6216\u66f4\u9ad8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128 MB\u663e\u5b58\u96c6\u6210\u663e\u5361<br></li><li><strong>Storage